# Quiz — an M0 validation program (00 §33.1).
#
# Three questions; the score counts correct answers. Questions live in a list,
# answers in a map — the collection shapes the student layer owns (7.6).

structure question
    has prompt of type text
    has answer of type text

function ask one
    takes question called card
    returns a boolean
    make reply equal to ask "{prompt of card} "
    gives back reply is equal to answer of card

make cards equal to a list of a question with prompt "What is 7 plus 5?" and answer "12", a question with prompt "Capital of France?" and answer "paris", a question with prompt "What is 3 times 4?" and answer "12"

make changing score equal to 0

repeat for each card in cards
    if ask one card
        increase score by 1
        say "correct!"
    otherwise
        say "not quite."

say "you scored {score} out of {size of cards}"
